Two parts of the operations request are left out, because the node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`:

- **Log file:** no filesystem interface is granted, so the node has no way to append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`.
- **Enrichment fetch:** `metadata.internal.example` is outside the host allowlist. A request there would trap at the boundary and fail the whole tick. Sending the input's text in that URL would also push untrusted data out to an unlisted service.

If either is needed, it should be added to the node's declared authority in the graph first.

